		"name": "FinTrackPortal API",
		"description": "FinTrack WHIZ SOLUTIONS - Complete API Collection\n\nSetup:\n1. Import this collection\n2. Import environment (Dev or Production)\n3. Select environment from top-right dropdown\n4. Login first - token is auto-saved\n5. All other APIs use the token automatically",
